WEBVTT

00:08:55.593 --> 00:09:00.306
that Philadelphia was running
a forfeiture machine.

00:09:01.423 --> 00:09:04.593
Between 2002 and 2016,

00:09:04.617 --> 00:09:10.286
Philadelphia took more than 77 million
dollars through forfeiture,

00:09:10.310 --> 00:09:14.051
including 1,200 homes.

00:09:14.931 --> 00:09:18.405
Cars, jewelry, electronics --
all of it they sold,

00:09:18.429 --> 00:09:19.738
the proceeds they kept.

00:09:19.762 --> 00:09:21.831
And they would have
kept right on doing it,

00:09:21.855 --> 00:09:24.256
had it not been
for a class-action lawsuit --

00:09:24.280 --> 00:09:26.866
our team's class-action lawsuit --

00:09:26.890 --> 00:09:33.088
(Applause and cheers)